{"id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-relation.md","title":"Binary Relation","display":"df-relation — Binary Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-relation","aliases":["58-df-relation"],"display":"df-relation — Binary Relation","depends_on":["[[58-df-cartesian]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relation — Binary Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"445e1cd0bb5274eb\" href=\"?note=445e1cd0bb5274eb\" title=\"58-df-cartesian\">58-df-cartesian</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,A,B\\in V\">\\(R,A,B\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; A\\in V\\land B\\in V\\land R\\subseteq A\\times B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; A\\in V\\land B\\in V\\land R\\subseteq A\\times B\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\upharpoonright(A_0\\times B_0)\">\\(R\\upharpoonright(A_0\\times B_0)\\)</span> is the restriction of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> to source part <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0\">\\(A_0\\)</span> and target part <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_0\">\\(B_0\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R[A_0]\">\\(R[A_0]\\)</span> is the image of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0\">\\(A_0\\)</span> under the relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cartesian","status":"resolved","id":"445e1cd0bb5274eb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cartesian]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R,A,B\\in V$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rel}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; A\\in V\\land B\\in V\\land R\\subseteq A\\times B","display":true},{"tex":"R\\upharpoonright(A_0\\times B_0)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"A_0","display":fal